{
  "page": 586,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5801,
      "text": "When the sun is wrapped up in darkness,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5802,
      "text": "and when the stars fall down,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5803,
      "text": "and when the mountains are set in motion,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5804,
      "text": "and when pregnant camels[1] are left unattended,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5805,
      "text": "and when wild beasts are gathered,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5806,
      "text": "and when the seas are set on fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5807,
      "text": "and when the souls are sorted[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5808,
      "text": "and when the baby girl buried alive[3] is asked,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5809,
      "text": "for what crime she was killed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5810,
      "text": "and when records of deeds are spread open,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5811,
      "text": "and when the sky is stripped away[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5812,
      "text": "and when the Blazing Fire is flared up,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5813,
      "text": "and when Paradise is brought near –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5814,
      "text": "then every soul will know what it has brought about[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5815,
      "text": "I swear by the receding stars,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5816,
      "text": "that rise and hide[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5817,
      "text": "and by the night as it departs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5818,
      "text": "and by the day as it breaks –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5819,
      "text": "Indeed, this [Qur’an] is a word conveyed by a noble angel-messenger.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5820,
      "text": "extremely powerful, highly revered by the Lord of the Throne,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5821,
      "text": "obeyed there [by other angels] and trustworthy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5822,
      "text": "Your fellow [i.e., the Prophet] is not a madman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5823,
      "text": "He indeed saw him [i.e., Gabriel] on the clear horizon[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5824,
      "text": "He does not withhold [knowledge of] the unseen[8].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5825,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is not the word of an accursed devil.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5826,
      "text": "So which way are you going[9]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5827,
      "text": "It is but a reminder to the worlds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5828,
      "text": "for those among you who wish to take the straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5829,
      "text": "But you cannot wish except by the Will of Allah, the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 81,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّكۡوِيرِ",
        "englishName": "At-Takwir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Overthrowing",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 586,
      "ruku": 523,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
